Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:00.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,Why is this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.69,0:00:01.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,truck holding a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.59,0:00:02.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,giant blade up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.55,0:00:03.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,at the sky?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.50,0:00:04.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,It's carrying a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.38,0:00:05.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,wind turbine blade
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.64,0:00:05.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,up a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.81,0:00:06.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,mountain road.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.92,0:00:07.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lying flat a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.68,0:00:08.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,blade this long
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.62,0:00:09.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,can't get around
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.57,0:00:10.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,these bends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.55,0:00:11.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,So the trailer
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.31,0:00:11.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,tilts it up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.99,0:00:12.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,as steep as
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.60,0:00:13.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,sixty degrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.00,0:00:14.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,At that angle
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.81,0:00:15.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,it sticks out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.54,0:00:16.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,only half
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.13,0:00:16.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,as far.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.01,0:00:17.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,And it can
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.45,0:00:18.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,swing the blade
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.20,0:00:19.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,sideways to clear
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.36,0:00:20.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,cliffs and trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.77,0:00:21.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,Some of these
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.43,0:00:22.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,blades are almost
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.41,0:00:23.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,as long as
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.06,0:00:24.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,a football field.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.32,0:00:25.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,The truck crawls
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.34,0:00:26.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,along at about
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.12,0:00:26.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,twelve miles
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.91,0:00:27.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.68,0:00:28.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,And if the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.14,0:00:29.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,wind blows over
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.04,0:00:29.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,twenty miles an
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.93,0:00:30.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,hour the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.33,0:00:31.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,trip stops.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.49,0:00:32.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,Tilting the blade
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.53,0:00:33.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,means the mountain
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.40,0:00:34.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,roads don't have
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.33,0:00:35.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,to be rebuilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.39,0:00:35.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,That's why you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.98,0:00:36.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,might meet a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.53,0:00:37.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,wind turbine blade
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.89,0:00:38.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,pointing at
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.48,0:00:39.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,the sky.
